Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.88,0:02:00.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that pestering feline is off to find\Nthe missing child and we're stuck here,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.80,0:02:02.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,not knowing what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.32,0:02:05.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somehow we have to find a way\Nto open that gate. But how?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:08.56,0:02:14.98,Sign,,0,0,300,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\3c&H000000&}{\fad(300,0)}{\fs30\b1}Pursuit! Hurry to Japan
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.42,0:02:18.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Iota's mind has shut the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.98,0:02:20.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't follow him now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.26,0:02:22.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, Pops, you've got to\Nhelp us get through that gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.64,0:02:24.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The eighth kid is doomed if we don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.40,0:02:25.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that isn't all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.52,0:02:26.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.43,0:02:28.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if that rotten creep goes on\Na rampage in the real world,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.84,0:02:30.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,lots of innocent people will get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.96,0:02:34.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There just has to be some way\Nwe can open the gate up again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.42,0:02:37.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, of course there is.\NNo kidding? How, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.44,0:02:41.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Any door can be opened\Nwith the right keys.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.54,0:02:44.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, don't be so mysterious, Gennai.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.28,0:02:48.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Follow me to my house, and\NI will explain everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.82,0:02:50.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's that? Look above.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.06,0:02:53.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What kind of directions are those?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.76,0:02:56.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very good ones if you\Nhave just listened. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.50,0:03:00.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep looking and you shall see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.84,0:03:03.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There, a searchlight.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.04,0:03:06.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I ran out of maps.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.28,0:03:09.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Follow the light and you can't miss it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.70,0:03:10.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.78,0:03:12.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Snack time for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.86,0:03:13.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's jet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.48,0:03:19.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like we're going to\Nbe doing a little swimming.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.54,0:03:21.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My hat, my beautiful hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.00,0:03:24.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Either we got those\Ndirections really wrong
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.60,0:03:26.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or Gennai's house is in\Nthe middle of a lake.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.94,0:03:28.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that's why I never found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.16,0:03:31.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Must be really tough\Nto get pizza delivered.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.96,0:03:34.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, come on in.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.18,0:03:35.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The water's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.98,0:03:36.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.62,0:03:47.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Steps?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.53,0:03:48.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, gang.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.45,0:03:49.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're in business.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.02,0:03:54.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are stairs going\Nright down into the lake.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.40,0:03:55.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They must lead to Gennai's house.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.92,0:03:57.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, what are we waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.74,0:04:00.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was kind of hoping we'd\Nsend a boat to make us up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.10,0:04:05.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.64,0:04:08.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If anyone wants any\Nsushi, now's your chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.44,0:04:10.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish I had my boats. Me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.12,0:04:15.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quite a place, if you don't\Nmind living in Pink Bog.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.86,0:04:16.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No lawn to Mo.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.46,0:04:18.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't see a doorbell.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.80,0:04:19.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Gennai!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.26,0:04:21.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're here! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.00,0:04:24.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who needs a doorbell\Nwith such noisy visitors?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.38,0:04:27.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, it's the real Gennai.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.56,0:04:29.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who did you expect, Santa Claus?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.78,0:04:31.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've just never seen the real you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.48,0:04:32.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.39,0:04:35.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So tell us, how come you're\Nalways hiding? I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.72,0:04:38.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you could have come in person, but\Nyou always choose projections, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.96,0:04:40.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just a show to impress you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.58,0:04:42.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What kind of a person are you, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.12,0:04:45.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A human or some kind of Digimon?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.30,0:04:47.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is not important.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.88,0:04:50.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How come you call us the Digidestined?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.06,0:04:56.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,easy i'm old but i'm not deaf you were\Nchosen to save this world in your own but
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.36,0:04:59.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,just how were we chosen\Nwhy us yeah we only
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.22,0:05:01.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,signed up for summer camp that is all you
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.68,0:05:06.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,need to know for now come inside the most\Nimportant thing is to return to your world
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.00,0:05:09.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and find the eighth child that and maybe
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.42,0:05:14.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,have a nice bowl of soup\Ntuna sandwich look at
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.66,0:05:18.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the fish but those are halibut they're
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.38,0:05:22.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Saltwater fish? You are\Nright, so I have to feed
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.54,0:05:25.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,them popcorn and salty pretzels and tons
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.20,0:05:27.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of salted nuts do you\Nthink he's pulling our
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.16,0:05:30.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,legs i have no idea now i'll look at the
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.42,0:05:35.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,weather state county city\Ndoes anyone recognize
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.66,0:05:39.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this area our hometown\Nand the red flashing
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.88,0:05:43.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Circle indicates Myotismon's location.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.24,0:05:45.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My Myotismon!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.52,0:05:48.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, he's only a mile\Nfrom where we all live.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.34,0:05:49.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid so.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.06,0:05:52.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll bet you that he goes downtown.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.42,0:05:53.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.04,0:05:59.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What'd you find? Nothing.\NThe table's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.34,0:06:02.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what's causing all this interference?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.04,0:06:10.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please tell us how to open\Nthe gate back to our world.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.00,0:06:12.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You certainly are impatient.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.82,0:06:15.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep your goggles on, my young friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.22,0:06:19.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll need these.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.20,0:06:21.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Check them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.18,0:06:22.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, teaching my key cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.68,0:06:25.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the spinning image.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.84,0:06:27.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, look at Gomamon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.44,0:06:28.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm cuter in person.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.96,0:06:30.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There I am, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.42,0:06:31.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what are they for?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.16,0:06:34.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and how do they\Nhelp us open the gate?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.34,0:06:37.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, there are nine holes on\Nthe stone wall of the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.66,0:06:40.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, so... Oh, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.50,0:06:42.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do the cards go into the holes?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.34,0:06:44.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.25,0:06:46.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, take a closer look.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.20,0:06:48.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not quite as simple as that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.60,0:06:49.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you see the problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.14,0:06:52.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're giving us one too many cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.94,0:06:54.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.85,0:06:56.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One of them is a fake.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.20,0:07:00.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll try them all till we\Nget the right combination.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.72,0:07:03.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, you will not, you silly boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.20,0:07:05.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's absolutely the\Nlast thing you should do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.40,0:07:06.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're a move.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.46,0:07:09.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you put the cards in the\Nwrong holes, it'll be a disaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.96,0:07:13.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could end up in a different\Nworld with no way to return.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.84,0:07:15.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.52,0:07:19.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The wrong cards might\Ntake you to a world where,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.28,0:07:21.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for example, people in\NDigimon switch skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.56,0:07:24.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, not that!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.52,0:07:25.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I like my skin!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.00,0:07:27.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.62,0:07:29.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not going to switch\Nyour skin with anyone
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.50,0:07:32.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,as long as you learn how\Nto use the cards correctly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.22,0:07:34.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we don't have any idea what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.44,0:07:38.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must learn to use your power\Nthe way my Otis Mon is using his.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.22,0:07:42.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow I'll teach you the\Nproper use of the cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.04,0:07:49.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The digital world is like\Nour world, but different.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.02,0:07:50.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.16,0:07:53.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The same material is used in all worlds.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.42,0:07:56.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Molecules and atoms? Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.90,0:08:00.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything here in the digital\Nworld, plants, trees, buildings,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.22,0:08:03.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,even the Digimon themselves came\Nfrom computer data in your world.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.58,0:08:08.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So if there are strange things here, they\Nare the result of broken or missing data.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.40,0:08:09.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What about you, Gennai?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.48,0:08:12.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you just made up of\Ncomputer data, too? Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.96,0:08:16.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So in each of the worlds, I\Nwould appear somewhat different.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.58,0:08:19.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, Gennai, if you're not human,\Nhow are you different from Digimon?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.86,0:08:21.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have no attributes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.96,0:08:22.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Attributes?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.87,0:08:24.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just what does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.48,0:08:27.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean the different\Nattacks Digimon have?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.14,0:08:29.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes. And the way a Digimon Digivolves.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.00,0:08:32.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But attributes determine\Nmuch more than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.44,0:08:35.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They explain why some Digimon\Nare good and some are evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.96,0:08:39.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All Digimon can be classified\Nas data, virus, or vaccine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.32,0:08:41.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're definitely familiar\Nwith the virus kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.48,0:08:45.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way, have you used that\NDigimon analyzer I gave you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.64,0:08:49.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, but there is something I wanted\Nto ask you about. What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.20,0:08:53.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm only able to access information\Non Digimon that I have seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.32,0:08:56.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not on the ones that the\Nother kids have seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.06,0:08:58.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right, that is a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.26,0:09:00.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it one that you can solve?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.80,0:09:03.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just leave it to me, my young friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.32,0:09:05.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should have it all\Ntaken care of by morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.88,0:09:09.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But for now, you had\Nbetter get some rest. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.18,0:09:13.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, Joe, why not just eat the bones, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.70,0:09:14.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, I was hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.50,0:09:16.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.40,0:09:19.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good morning, all. Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.92,0:09:23.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Izzy, I completed the\Nmodifications for your computer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.68,0:09:26.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you insert someone's\NDigivice into this adapter,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.68,0:09:30.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The analyzer will show information\Non any Digimon that person has seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.28,0:09:33.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I also installed a new screensaver.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.62,0:09:35.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, the one with the\Ncolored fishes swimming around?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.84,0:09:36.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I really like that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.06,0:09:38.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great minds do think alike.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.74,0:09:40.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now I have a request for all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.80,0:09:43.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want you to forget\Nthat you are the Digidestined.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.42,0:09:45.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll never forget this stomachache.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.68,0:09:46.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joe, this is serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.28,0:09:48.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have done all I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.88,0:09:53.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can no longer help you once you return\Nto my Otismon's castle. Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.76,0:09:59.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, this place looks even scarier\Nthan it did the first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.48,0:10:21.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do we get past the Devidramon?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.28,0:10:22.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave that to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.78,0:10:24.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take him out while you go in
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.28,0:10:52.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Choo-choo!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.74,0:10:56.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Beg-a-kabu-terry-mon!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.56,0:11:00.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go! Now's our chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.68,0:11:03.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Horn Buster!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.36,0:11:08.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go get it, go get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.00,0:11:11.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, so much for our quiet entrance.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.04,0:11:12.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Horn Buster!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.28,0:11:22.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mojyamon!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.94,0:11:24.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, what happened? Is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.72,0:11:27.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything's turned all\Nright-side up again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.44,0:11:28.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You fixed the warp in space.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.92,0:11:30.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's get to the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.84,0:11:36.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got to figure out\Nthe pattern in these cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.46,0:11:38.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, a clue?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.38,0:11:43.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good one, bad one, funky one.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.00,0:11:46.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe in-training rookie and champion?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.84,0:11:50.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or could it just be small\None, medium one, big one?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.12,0:11:53.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,how can we be sure and we still\Ndon't have a clue which card
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.32,0:11:58.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is the fake one maybe it's where\Nthey live water or land maybe
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.40,0:12:01.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the key is in their names like\NAgumon starts with a that's
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.92,0:12:07.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,letter number one then oh no it\Nreally doesn't make any sense izzy
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.28,0:12:10.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what are you looking at my otis\Nmom used a spell to open the
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.06,0:12:13.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,gate and i think this picture\Nmust have something to do with it
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.70,0:12:17.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,some of these characters i know\Nsagittarius and leo are signs of
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.52,0:12:20.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the zodiac but there's nothing\Nabout a monkey in any horoscope,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.74,0:12:23.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and what's the significance\Nof this star pattern?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.52,0:12:27.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Matt, what's that sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.86,0:12:28.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.22,0:12:32.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, maybe somebody\Nshould go try to find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.94,0:12:34.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.94,0:12:36.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to figure out the cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.44,0:12:38.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, let's go. What's the point?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.72,0:12:39.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll never unlock the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.00,0:12:41.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't even say that, Joe.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.10,0:12:44.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if we put the cards in\Nthe hole so they look right,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.76,0:12:47.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we have no way of knowing\Nuntil it's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.12,0:12:48.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to try, Joe.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.28,0:12:55.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,something tells me we don't\Nhave much time hey everyone
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.32,0:12:57.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the walls and ceilings and\Nthe castle are caving in the
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.82,0:13:00.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,passages are all blocked that\Nmeans we can't go back the
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.46,0:13:04.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,way we came in we're trapped\Nnow we have to open the gate one
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.30,0:13:06.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of us has to choose nine cards\Nand put them in the holes
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.66,0:13:12.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and that'll be that you Tai me\Nyeah it's your call mine why
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.20,0:13:15.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is it up to me i'm not trying\Nto put you on the spot or
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.12,0:13:18.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,anything like that i just think\Nwe all really believe in you
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.62,0:13:20.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tai? Me? Joe's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.74,0:13:24.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In times like these, decisions need\Nto be made by the one in charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.24,0:13:25.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.15,0:13:26.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you guys all gone crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.12,0:13:26.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who made me leader?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.04,0:13:28.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you remember when you were gone, Tai?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.76,0:13:30.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We fell apart without you around.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.80,0:13:31.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And after all that,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.76,0:13:34.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,weren't you the one who managed to\Nbring us all back together again?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.56,0:13:35.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, yeah, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.78,0:13:36.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just do it, Tai!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.69,0:13:37.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh. Mimi?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.04,0:13:40.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just want to get back\Nto my home, that's all!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.02,0:13:42.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.30,0:13:44.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.24,0:13:45.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was being selfish again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.64,0:13:46.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to remember we're a team.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.00,0:13:48.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Tai, save the day!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.90,0:13:50.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we have to believe in our friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.04,0:13:52.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember what Gennai said?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.72,0:13:54.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he said to believe in our power.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.96,0:13:57.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You believe, don't you, Tai? Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.66,0:14:00.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, we've gone through\Na lot of weird stuff already.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.40,0:14:03.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we hadn't stuck together, we\Nnever would have beaten Seadramon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.36,0:14:04.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or smashed Tyranomon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.80,0:14:06.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or escaped from Toy Town.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.40,0:14:10.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'd still be making french fries in\NVegemon's diner if you hadn't saved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.20,0:14:11.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can do it, Tai.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.60,0:14:12.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can do it, Tai!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.80,0:14:15.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.96,0:14:25.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so you're leaving it up to me to get\Nthis gate open huh and whatever i decide
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.10,0:14:31.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is the best way you're all willing\Nto go along with it well i've decided
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.36,0:14:37.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i want izzy to do it what you do why\Nme if that's what Tai thinks i accept
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.88,0:14:42.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it me too don't worry izzy Tai believes\Nin you and so do the rest of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.34,0:14:44.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what happens if I'm wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.22,0:14:45.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one will blame you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.60,0:14:47.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We all know you're the right one for the
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.30,0:14:49.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,job, Izzy. Go for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.80,0:14:52.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I still have no idea how\Nthis all fits together.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.50,0:14:55.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe you could use your\Ncomputer to help figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.18,0:14:56.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The computer?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.22,0:14:58.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, right now I'd rather\Nuse it to log onto the
Dialogue: 1,0:15:01.25,0:15:01.75,Sign,,0,0,130,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\b1}Devimon{\b0}
Dialogue: 1,0:15:02.00,0:15:02.50,Sign,,0,0,130,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\b1}Leomon{\b0}
Dialogue: 1,0:15:02.75,0:15:03.25,Sign,,0,0,130,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\b1}Ogremon{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.14,0:15:05.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,internet and book us a\Nflight out of this place.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:03.50,0:15:04.00,Sign,,0,0,130,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\b1}Kentarumon{\b0}
Dialogue: 1,0:15:04.29,0:15:05.00,Sign,,0,0,130,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\b1}Whamon{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.22,0:15:06.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:05.67,0:15:06.30,Sign,,0,0,110,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\b1}Whamon{\b0}
Dialogue: 1,0:15:06.50,0:15:06.75,Sign,,0,0,110,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\b1\fad(0,200)}Kentarumon{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.94,0:15:10.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The horse, the lion, and\Nthen The monkey, that's it!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:08.01,0:15:08.30,Sign,,0,0,110,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\b1\fad(0,200)}Leomon{\b0}
Dialogue: 1,0:15:11.34,0:15:11.84,Sign,,0,0,130,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\b1}Etemon{\b0}
Dialogue: 1,0:15:12.14,0:15:13.60,Sign,,270,0,278,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\b1}Etemon{\b0}
Dialogue: 1,0:15:12.14,0:15:13.60,Sign,,0,0,90,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\b1}Leomon{\b0}
Dialogue: 1,0:15:12.14,0:15:13.60,Sign,,0,270,278,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\b1}Kentarumon{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.32,0:15:19.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember, all Digimon can be classified\Nas data, virus, or vaccine. Could it be?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:20.60,0:15:21.23,Sign,,40,0,70,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\fs27}Adult
Dialogue: 1,0:15:20.60,0:15:21.23,Sign,,40,0,130,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\fs27}Vaccine
Dialogue: 1,0:15:20.60,0:15:21.23,Sign,,300,0,315,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\fs27}Data
Dialogue: 1,0:15:20.60,0:15:21.23,Sign,,0,250,260,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\fs27}Perfect
Dialogue: 1,0:15:20.60,0:15:21.23,Sign,,0,250,320,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\fs27}Virus
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.04,0:15:24.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who here has met up with\NDigitamamon and Gekkomon? I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.16,0:15:26.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give me your Digivice.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:27.90,0:15:29.19,Sign,,0,0,130,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\b1}TonosamaGeckomon{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.96,0:15:30.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Brodigis!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.87,0:15:31.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You figured it out?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.00,0:15:33.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I might have.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.82,0:15:35.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, guys, check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.44,0:15:38.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The first three, the lion,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.00,0:15:43.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The archer, and the monkey, would\Nbe Leomon, Centarumon, and Etemon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.22,0:15:47.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In addition, there's one\Nof each classification.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.18,0:15:48.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Data, virus, and vaccine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.32,0:15:54.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The stars starting at the top represent\Nin-training, rookie, and champion.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.52,0:15:56.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So now we can put all the\Ncards in the right squares.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.94,0:15:57.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You did it, Izzy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.04,0:15:58.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good work.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.95,0:16:00.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We knew you'd figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.26,0:16:01.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.30,0:16:02.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not so fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.21,0:16:07.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are two cards here. One of them\Nis the fake, but I don't know which one.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.12,0:16:09.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that's it
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.82,0:16:10.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.90,0:16:14.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we still can't be certain where the gate\Nwill open to But we made it this far,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.04,0:16:15.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that's great
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.40,0:16:22.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes it is I can pick which\None's fake If I can't,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.62,0:16:25.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,everyone gets an ice cream, and I'm buying
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.36,0:16:27.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.40,0:16:28.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.40,0:16:30.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.54,0:16:34.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.14,0:16:36.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you in just a minute.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:36.93,0:16:44.94,Sign,,0,0,100,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\b1}Dokugumon{\b0}
Dialogue: 1,0:16:36.93,0:16:44.94,Sign,,370,0,135,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Adult
Dialogue: 1,0:16:36.93,0:16:44.94,Sign,,370,0,175,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Virus
Dialogue: 1,0:16:36.93,0:16:44.94,Sign,,370,0,220,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Insect Digimon
Dialogue: 1,0:16:36.93,0:16:44.94,Sign,,370,0,305,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Special Attack
Dialogue: 1,0:16:36.93,0:16:44.94,Sign,,370,0,340,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Stinger Pollation
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.66,0:16:44.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Dokugumon, an evil Digimon with\Ncomputer virus parasites covering his body.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.86,0:16:47.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Intruders in the castle must be destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.76,0:16:48.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't get them!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.22,0:16:56.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, digital monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.32,0:16:57.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon are the champions.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.28,0:17:00.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tokomon, Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.22,0:17:02.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hikari!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.14,0:17:08.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tailmon, Digivolve!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.62,0:17:10.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tokomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.94,0:17:16.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gabumon, Digivolve!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.50,0:17:18.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Garurumon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.16,0:17:20.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.50,0:17:24.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Blue Blaster!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.08,0:17:29.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry, hurry, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.10,0:17:31.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're running out of time!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.32,0:17:34.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Needle Cray!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.92,0:17:35.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Harpoon Torpedo!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.62,0:17:39.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.58,0:17:53.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't decide which one is the fake.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.46,0:17:57.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I choose wrong, we're toast.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.84,0:18:03.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Poison pin
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.42,0:18:11.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Poison cobweb
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.92,0:18:18.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Garurumon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.06,0:18:20.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digivolve again! Grr!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.28,0:18:22.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.38,0:18:25.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon! Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.42,0:18:27.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon monsters to the planet champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.70,0:18:30.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Garurumon! Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.26,0:18:32.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooh!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.50,0:18:33.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.00,0:18:35.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Into ultimate!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.14,0:18:39.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,WereGarurumon! Ooh!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.66,0:18:43.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Digimon! Hey, Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.06,0:18:47.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Monster friends to the boys and\Ngirls Hey, Digimon, hey, Digimon
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.26,0:18:52.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tai, you've got to make up your mind now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.64,0:18:53.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're out of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.04,0:18:56.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, it's this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.28,0:19:01.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Monster friends to the boys and girls\NHey, Digimon, hey, Digimon Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.14,0:19:07.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's opening! It worked!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.98,0:19:09.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the one, Gomamon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.16,0:19:09.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Open the gate!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.76,0:19:15.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave him and come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.38,0:19:17.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll never get out of here in one piece!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.04,0:19:29.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was real close, Snimon,\Nbut it looks like we made it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.26,0:19:51.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are we? I know this place.\NThis is the summer camp where we all
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.46,0:19:53.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,met you did it Tai we're home again
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.86,0:19:59.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we're back to where we were first
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.14,0:20:03.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sucked into the digital world but\Nwhere are our digimon i wonder if we
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.52,0:20:08.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,got the cards wrong after all then in\Nthis world we could be without them
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.82,0:20:10.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't get rid of us that easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.60,0:20:13.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.58,0:20:16.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, sleepyheads! We're up! We're up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.10,0:20:17.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where have you been?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.10,0:20:19.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We thought we oughta go\Nlook for a little lunch!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.30,0:20:22.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that we're home, we don't\Nhave to eat leaves anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.02,0:20:24.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can eat cheeseburgers!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.14,0:20:24.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.05,0:20:26.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And pepperoni pizza!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.16,0:20:26.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And french fries!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.07,0:20:29.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And ice cream! Yeah! And broccoli!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.84,0:20:30.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Broccoli?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.75,0:20:31.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Broccoli?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.67,0:20:33.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did you know that my\Ncard was the fake, Tai?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.72,0:20:34.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.12,0:20:37.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I kept your card because you're my friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.74,0:20:41.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that's so nice hey everybody\Nwe've got to go and
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.12,0:20:43.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,find the eighth child yeah\Nand we've got to get a
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.66,0:20:46.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,move on since my Otis\Nmonth's there ahead of us I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.76,0:20:49.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,happy that we're finally\Nheaded back to my hometown
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.52,0:20:52.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and we already know that's where\Nwe're going to find the eighth child
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.88,0:20:53.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,let's go
